<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<doxygen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="compound.xsd" version="0.0.0" xml:lang="en-US">
	<compounddef id="blog_2026_04_11" kind="page">
		<compoundname>blog_2026_04_11</compoundname>
		<title>More Media</title>
		<briefdescription></briefdescription>
		<detaileddescription>
			<para>
				<mcss:footernavigation xmlns:mcss="http://mcss.mosra.cz/doxygen/"/>
			</para>
			<para>A second post carrying its own <computeroutput>diagram.png</computeroutput>. Doxygen resolves images by basename, so before poxy staged these per-post the two files collided and only one of them reached the output.</para>
			<para>
				<htmlonly> &lt;img class="m-image" src="blog/2026-04-11/diagram.png" alt="a red square" /&gt;</htmlonly>
			</para>
			<para>An image already inside a link keeps its own destination, and gets no lightbox wrapper:</para>
			<para>
				<htmlonly> &lt;a href="https://example.com/"&gt;&lt;img class="m-image" src="blog/2026-04-11/diagram.png" alt="a linked red square" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</htmlonly>
			</para>
			<para>An svg is injected into the document instead, so it gets no wrapper either:</para>
			<para>
				<htmlonly> &lt;img class="m-image" src="blog/2026-04-11/circle.svg" alt="a green circle" /&gt;</htmlonly>
			</para>
		</detaileddescription>
		<location file="poxy_blog_blog_2026_04_11.dox"/>
	</compounddef>
</doxygen>